---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PhotoGrid from '../../../../shared/components/PhotoGrid.astro';
import Footer from '../../../../shared/components/Footer.astro';

import p1 from '../assets/gallery/1.jpeg';
import p2 from '../assets/gallery/2.jpeg';
import p3 from '../assets/gallery/3.jpeg';
import p4 from '../assets/gallery/4.jpeg';
import p5 from '../assets/gallery/5.png';
import p6 from '../assets/gallery/6.jpeg';
import p7 from '../assets/gallery/7.jpeg';
import p8 from '../assets/gallery/8.jpeg';
import p9 from '../assets/gallery/9.jpeg';

const photos = [p1, p2, p3, p4, p5, p6, p7, p8, p9];

const footerLinks = [
    { label: 'hosts', href: '/hosts' },
    { label: 'contact us', href: 'mailto:neil.shroff@gmail.com' },
    { label: 'twitter', href: 'https://x.com/search?q=bangerlore%20min_faves%3A15%20until%3A2026-01-01%20since%3A2024-05-01&src=typed_query&f=live' },
    { label: 'basedcon', href: 'https://basedcon.xyz' },
];
---

<Base
    title="Bangerlore"
    description="Invite-only house parties in Bangalore for engineers, hackers, scientists, designers, and investors."
>
    <Fragment slot="head">
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    </Fragment>

    <div class="announcement-banner">
        <span class="announcement-text">Thank you for coming to Bangerlore v5!</span>
        <a href="https://partiful.com/e/qQ5j2mNkpfIittsNo34X?c=pi741r-6" class="announcement-link">Pictures here &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <h1>Bangerlore 🍻</h1>
    <h2>hosting tech parties we'd want to be attendees at</h2>

    <p>We realized networking events weren't the best way to meet people, and there weren't nearly enough good, big parties to go to. So since early 2024, we've been hosting an invite-only house party in Bangalore. We vet every single attendee, including some of the best engineers, hackers, scientists, researchers, designers, lawyers and investors we've met over time (80%) + some friends &amp; family of ours from all phases of life (15%) + interesting people with no circle who have just moved to the city (5%).</p>

    <p>It's a party, but we take organizing it seriously and as a matter of great responsibility. Our self-imposed KPIs are:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>no. of angel cheques raised at the party</li>
        <li>no. of long-term collaborations or relationships forged at the party</li>
        <li>no. of people fly into the city to attend</li>
        <li>% of no-shows (they face a 1-year ban)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Around 250 people attend each time and the party goes on for ~12 hours from 4PM to 4AM. Proof of previous parties: <a href="https://partiful.com/e/CrOv3DkZSWGkoF0SsFIB">v1</a>, <a href="https://partiful.com/e/Ep5WovOmFAZRHhMbusFj">v2</a>, <a href="https://partiful.com/e/CjK5wpCKdVs8rdeeVdya">v3</a>, <a href="https://partiful.com/e/U964NJ2siC9E6IhzmVkj">v4</a>. To browse some of the lore that followed Bangerlore, see <a href="https://x.com/search?q=bangerlore%20min_faves%3A15%20until%3A2026-01-01%20since%3A2024-05-01&src=typed_query&f=live">here</a>.</p>

    <PhotoGrid images={photos} alt="Bangerlore party photo" />

    <Footer links={footerLinks} />
</Base>

<style>
    .announcement-banner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 18px;
        margin: -30px -20px 20px;
        padding: 12px 32px;
        background: #d23847;
        color: #1a0a0c;
        font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 500;
        box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    }

    .announcement-link,
    .announcement-link:visited {
        color: #1a0a0c;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .announcement-link:hover {
        opacity: 0.75;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .announcement-banner {
            margin: -25px -20px 16px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 15px;
            gap: 8px;
        }
    }
</style>
